Oft-mentioned spoiler follows

Just sacrifice at the altar. You'll sense a conflict between your
god and the one who the altar is to. The altar will then convert
or not (I think this has something to do with luck -- at least
it says things like "Unluckily, you feel the power of Morrigan decrease"
or "Luckily, you feel the power of Morrigan increase".)

If you are succesful, you'll also get "The newly consecrated altar
glows <color>." 

If it doesn't work the first time, keep trying. 

a minor related spoiler:


BTW, save those lawful altars until you've made all the holy
water you want to make!

